# <configuration> <test> <seed>
# Every test runs on every configuration. test_random_traffic runs seeds 1-10 on the default
# configuration and seeds 1-3 elsewhere.
# test_checker_fault is not listed: it must end in FAIL and is run once by hand to confirm that
# the checker reports errors.
